Subject: Legend.key blacked out
Message-ID: <T6_xmJTOutc.C2xt5lyh4B8J@ggplot2.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/ggplot2/c/T6_xmJTOutc/m/C2xt5lyh4B8J>
