Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Try this:

m + geom_jitter(position = position_jitter(width = 0.15)) +

        stat_summary(fun.ymin = median, fun.ymax = median, col =
"red", geom = "errorbar", width = 0.3) +
        scale_x_continuous(breaks = c(1, 2, 3, 4)) +xlab("time point")

+ ylab("total score")

--
http://learnr.wordpress.com

